
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fff0f6">
<title>For My Kyuutu ♡</title>

<style>
:root {
  --pink: #f3a6c5;
  --deep: #8c4268;
  --cream: #fff7fa;
  --ink: #593548;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg,#fff0f6,#fff9fc,#fce6f0);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: center;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
section { padding: 65px 20px; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem,10vw,4rem); margin: 15px 0; }
h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
p { line-height: 1.8; }
.eyebrow { letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: .72rem; }
.hero {
  min-height: 100svh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 35px 20px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero:before {
  content: "♡";
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 19rem;
  color: #f7cade;
  opacity: .28;
  top: 10%;
  left: -60px;
  transform: rotate(-20deg);
}
.hero > * { position: relative; }
.hero-icon { font-size: 4rem; animation: bob 3s infinite ease-in-out; }
.subtitle { max-width: 330px; }
button {
  border: 0;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: var(--deep);
  color: white;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 1rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 7px 20px #8c426826;
  transition: transform .2s;
}
button:active { transform: scale(.96); }
button.secondary { background: #f7d7e5; color: #713c57; }
button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #6c294c; outline-offset: 4px; }
.small-note { font-size: .85rem; opacity: .75; }
.card {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 22px auto;
  padding: 26px;
  border: 1px solid #f2c5d8;
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: #ffffffb8;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px #a94c7010;
}
.hidden { display: none !important; }
.reveal { animation: appear .7s ease both; }
#letter {
  text-align: left;
  white-space: pre-line;
  line-height: 2;
}
.gallery {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 25px auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 14px;
}
.photo {
  background: white;
  padding: 9px 9px 17px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #8c42681c;
  transform: rotate(-2deg);
}
.photo:nth-child(even) { transform: rotate(2deg); }
.photo img {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: #f8dce8;
}
.photo p { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: .9rem; }
.cake { font-size: 6rem; margin: 15px; }
#flame { display: inline-block; }
#finalWish { line-height: 2; }
footer { padding: 35px 15px; font-size: .9rem; }
.heart {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -30px;
  z-index: 10;
  pointer-events: none;
  animation: floatUp 5s linear forwards;
}
@keyframes floatUp {
  to { transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg); opacity: 0; }
}
@keyframes bob {
  50% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(4deg); }
}
@keyframes appear {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-icon">💌</div>
  <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING JUST FOR YOU</p>
  <h1>For my<br>Kyuutu ♡</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Some surprises are better opened slowly.
    This one was made especially for you, Anuska.
  </p>
  <button onclick="openSurprise()">Open your surprise 💗</button>
  <p class="small-note">Made with love, just for you.</p>
</section>

<section id="welcome">
  <p class="eyebrow">TODAY IS YOUR DAY</p>
  <h2>Happy Birthday, Anuska! 🎂</h2>
  <p>
    To the girl who makes ordinary moments feel a little more special.
    Today, this tiny corner of the internet belongs to you.
  </p>
  <button class="secondary" onclick="showLetter()">A little letter for you 💌</button>
  <div id="letterCard" class="card hidden">
    <h2>Dear Kyuutu ♡</h2>
    <p id="letter"></p>
    <p style="text-align:right">With lots of love,<br>Biraja ♡</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="memories">
  <p class="eyebrow">LITTLE MOMENTS, BIG FEELINGS</p>
  <h2>Our little memory book 📸</h2>
  <p>Every picture holds a little story.</p>
  <div class="gallery">
    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Our favourite memory one">
      <p>One of my favourite moments ♡</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Our favourite memory two">
      <p>A memory worth keeping 🌸</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo3.jpg" alt="Our favourite memory three">
      <p>Just us being us 💗</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo4.jpg" alt="Our favourite memory four">
      <p>More memories to come ✨</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="small-note">Add your own photos to make this section yours.</p>
</section>

<section id="cakeSection">
  <p class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE WISH</p>
  <h2>A cake just for you 🎂</h2>
  <div class="cake" aria-label="Birthday cake">
    🎂<span id="flame">🕯️</span>
  </div>
  <p id="cakeMessage">Ready for your birthday surprise?</p>
  <button onclick="blowCandle()">Make a wish ✨</button>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="card">
    <p class="eyebrow">ONE LAST LITTLE THING</p>
    <h2>Before you go… ♡</h2>
    <p>
      I hope this new year of your life brings you peaceful days,
      happy surprises, lovely memories, and so many reasons to smile.
    </p>
    <button onclick="showFinal()">Open your final surprise 💝</button>
    <div id="finalWish" class="hidden reveal">
      <h2>You're so special, Kyuutu! 🌷</h2>
      <p>
        Happy Birthday, Anuska. Never forget how much joy you bring
        into the lives of the people who care about you.
      </p>
      <p>Here's to more smiles, more memories, and more beautiful days. ♡</p>
      <div style="font-size:2rem">🌸 💗 🌸</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>A little music? 🎶</h2>
  <p>Tap play if you'd like a soft birthday soundtrack.</p>
  <audio id="music" controls loop preload="none">
    <source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support audio.
  </audio>
  <p class="small-note">Music starts only when you press play.</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <div style="font-size:1.5rem">♡</div>
  Made for Anuska, with love from Biraja.<br>
  <span class="small-note">5 October 2026 · Always keep smiling 🌷</span>
</footer>

<script>
const message = `Happy Birthday, my Kyuutu! ♡

I made this little website just for you because I wanted your day to feel a little more special.

I hope you keep smiling, keep dreaming, and keep being the wonderful person you are.

Thank you for being part of my life and for all the little moments that mean more than words can say.

I cannot promise that every day will be perfect, but I hope your birthday is filled with warmth, happiness, and lovely memories.

Today is your day, Anuska. Enjoy every little bit of it.

Happy Birthday once again, Kyuutu! 🌸💗`;

function openSurprise() {
  document.getElementById("welcome").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth"});
  hearts(18);
}
function showLetter() {
  const card = document.getElementById("letterCard");
  card.classList.remove("hidden");
  document.getElementById("letter").textContent = message;
  card.classList.add("reveal");
  hearts(12);
}
let candleBlown = false;
function blowCandle() {
  const flame = document.getElementById("flame");
  const text = document.getElementById("cakeMessage");
  if (!candleBlown) {
    flame.textContent = "✨";
    text.textContent = "Wish made! May your year be full of beautiful things. 💗";
    candleBlown = true;
    hearts(25);
  } else {
    flame.textContent = "🕯️";
    text.textContent = "Your candle is glowing again. Make another wish! 🌸";
    candleBlown = false;
  }
}
function showFinal() {
  document.getElementById("finalWish").classList.remove("hidden");
  hearts(30);
}
function hearts(count) {
  const symbols = ["♡","💗","💕","✧","🌸"];
  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
    const heart = document.createElement("span");
    heart.className = "heart";
    heart.textContent = symbols[Math.floor(Math.random()*symbols.length)];
    heart.style.left = Math.random()*100 + "vw";
    heart.style.fontSize = (16+Math.random()*20) + "px";
    heart.style.animationDelay = (Math.random()*1.5) + "s";
    document.body.appendChild(heart);
    setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 7000);
  }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
